{"title":"Wednesday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/967765580/0/marginalrevolution~Wednesday-assorted-links.html","date":1786551123000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/indian_bronson/status/2086788314556727486?s=46&amp;t=fSypFxt84bBHId-do9r5Ag\" target=\"_blank\">The cheese collateral in Italian banks is melting</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/DanielKral1/status/2086841133393445365\" target=\"_blank\">Denmark fact of the day</a>: “…half of Denmark’s growth has been due to essentially one company”</p>\r\n<p>3. “<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/arpitrage/status/2086828588058235334?s=46&amp;t=fSypFxt84bBHId-do9r5Ag\" target=\"_blank\">Foreign travel now makes up 1.4% of the US consumer spending budget. By contrast, imported Chinese goods make up about 3% of US domestic expenditures.</a>”</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.noahpinion.blog/p/the-poverty-of-anti-tech-thought\" target=\"_blank\">Noah is right</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. “<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.theatlantic.com/ideas/2026/08/fertility-men-housework-goldin/688238/?gift=SDxDLe7vqwTbgOhZBtU9KmgjBsFDmt4IBliTgxEwR_0\" target=\"_blank\">For decades, men have been increasing their share of housework and child care. But the number of babies just keeps falling.</a>”</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/UMN_Econ/status/2087283852075045292\" target=\"_blank\">Christopher Phelan confirmed as new CEA chair</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/08/wednesday-assorted-links-566.html\">Wednesday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~